# krome_init_abund.dat -- modern Earth, CH4 + layered H2O (DRAFT 2026-11-18)
#
# Same as krome_init_abund_earth_modern_CH4only.dat plus a stepped H2O profile:
# moist up to the model's tropopause (T minimum, layer 59, ~350 hPa), dry above.
# Third column = pin depth in layers from the bottom (70-layer model).
#
# NEEDS a small marcs.f change: repeated lines for one species must STACK
# (later lines override earlier ones on the layers they cover). The current
# parser keeps only the last line per species.
#
CH4       1.9000E-06   # ~1900 ppb, biogenic source
#
H2O       4.0000E-06        # dry stratosphere, all layers (~4 ppmv)
H2O       1.3000E-03   12   # layers 59-70: upper troposphere (70% of saturation, 1.1-1.4e-3)
H2O       4.0000E-03    5   # layers 66-70: lower troposphere (70% of saturation, 2.0-6.4e-3)
